{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a customizable Shopify Featured Collection section matching my existing product cards.
    
    CARD LAYOUT:
    1. Product title using theme heading font
    2. Product image
    3. Dynamic price + optional variant price description
    4. Editable custom product description
    5. Optional Learn More link
    6. Variant buttons
    7. Add to Bag button
    
    ALIGNMENT:
    All desktop cards must be equal height and all Add to Bag buttons must align perfectly along the bottom, even when descriptions differ or only some products have variants.
    
    Use Flexbox/Grid with cards set to height:100% and an internal flexible area to push the purchase area to the bottom. Do NOT use absolute positioning or fixed card heights.
    
    PRODUCT IMAGE:
    Equal image area across cards. Include image ratio and contain/cover settings.
    
    PRICE + VARIANT PRICE DESCRIPTION:
    Display the selected variant's actual Shopify price.
    
    Allow an optional custom price description for EACH variant that dynamically changes when that variant is selected.
    
    Examples:
    1 Pod → $35.00
    3 Pods → $96.00 ($32 each)
    6 Pods → $168.00 ($28 each)
    
    The main $35/$96/$168 price must come from Shopify variant data. The "$32 each" and "$28 each" text should be editable supplementary text, not calculated pricing.
    
    If no variant price description exists, show only the price.
    
    VARIANTS:
    Always show variants as individual buttons, never dropdowns.
    
    When selected, dynamically update:
    - Price
    - Variant price description
    - Variant image
    - Availability
    - Selected variant ID
    - Add to Bag state
    
    Clearly indicate selected and sold-out variants. Quick Add must add the selected variant.
    
    DESCRIPTIONS:
    Allow a custom description for each displayed product through the Theme Editor, plus an optional Learn More link.
    
    ADD TO BAG:
    Full width and same height across cards. All desktop buttons must align along the bottom of the row. Must work with the Shopify cart/cart drawer.
    
    CUSTOMIZATION:
    Include Theme Editor controls for:
    - Collection and products shown
    - Desktop/mobile columns
    - Optional mobile carousel
    - Show/hide title, price, price description, description, Learn More, variants, Add to Bag
    - Image ratio/fit
    - Title, price and text sizes
    - Card padding/gap/border/radius
    - Variant button size/gap/border/radius
    - Section/card/title/price/text colors
    - Variant selected/unselected colors
    - Add to Bag colors/radius
    - Desktop/mobile section padding
    
    MOBILE:
    Fully responsive. Allow 1–2 columns or optional horizontal carousel. Variant buttons must wrap without overflowing.
    
    TECHNICAL:
    Use Shopify Liquid, CSS and JavaScript compatible with Online Store 2.0. Use real Shopify product/variant data with no hard-coded products, prices or variant IDs. Each card functions independently. Do not show duplicate prices., DESKTOP:
    - Cards should display 3 products evenly across the section
    - Each card should be approximately 30–33% of the available section width
    - Product images should have a normal product-card size and NOT expand based on the original image dimensions
    - Use a consistent square image container with aspect-ratio: 1 / 1
    - Image should use object-fit: contain
    - Image must stay fully contained inside the image area
    - Do not allow images to determine card height
    - Do not use viewport height or oversized minimum heights
    - Remove any fixed/minimum card height that makes cards excessively tall
    - Cards should only be as tall as needed for their content
    
    Keep:
    - Equal-height cards within each row
    - Product titles in heading font
    - Dynamic variant pricing
    - Variant price descriptions such as $96.00 ($32 each)
    - Variant buttons
    - Bottom-aligned Add to Bag buttons
    
    The desired structure should look like a normal Shopify collection grid:
    3 compact product cards across desktop, with proportional product images and product information directly underneath.
    
    Add Theme Editor controls for:
    - Maximum section width
    - Desktop columns
    - Image ratio
    - Image fit
    - Card gap
    - Card padding
    
    Do not change the existing variant selection, dynamic pricing, descriptions, or Add to Bag functionality., only show a carousel on mobile, not desktop, Remove the in-stock text. Add editable variant price description fields to the Theme Editor.
    
    Currently there is a "Show variant price description" toggle, but there is no way to enter the text for each variant.
    
    For EACH displayed product card, add editable text fields for up to 6 variants:
    
    - Variant 1 price description
    - Variant 2 price description
    - Variant 3 price description
    - Variant 4 price description
    - Variant 5 price description
    - Variant 6 price description
    
    These fields correspond to the product's variants in their Shopify order.
    
    Example for Elixir Pods:
    Variant 1: 1 Pod → leave blank
    Variant 2: 3 Pods → enter "$32 each"
    Variant 3: 6 Pods → enter "$28 each"
    
    When a variant is selected, dynamically display its corresponding price description next to the actual Shopify variant price:
    
    1 Pod:
    $35.00
    
    3 Pods:
    $96.00 ($32 each)
    
    6 Pods:
    $168.00 ($28 each)
    
    The main price must continue to come dynamically from Shopify. The custom field only controls the supplementary text in parentheses.
    
    If the price description field is blank, show only the Shopify price.
    
    The variant price description must update immediately when a variant button is selected.
    
    Add these fields to the Theme Editor underneath the product card description settings.
    
    Do not change the current card layout, sizing, styling, variant buttons, descriptions, or Add to Bag functionality., Remove the in-stock and sold out text. 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% assign featured_collection = block.settings.collection %}
{% style %}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:{{ block.settings.padding_desktop }}px {{ block.settings.side_padding }}px;background:{{ block.settings.section_color }};color:{{ block.settings.text_color }}}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-inner{width:100%;max-width:{{ block.settings.max_section_width }}px;margin-inline:auto}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-heading{font-family:{{ settings.type_header_font.family }},{{ settings.type_header_font.fallback_families }};margin:0 0 24px;color:{{ block.settings.title_color }};font-size:{{ block.settings.title_size }}px}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat({{ block.settings.columns_desktop }},minmax(0,1fr));gap:{{ block.settings.gap }}px;align-items:stretch}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:{{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;border:1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};border-radius:{{ block.settings.card_radius }}px;background:{{ block.settings.card_color }}}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-title{font-family:{{ settings.type_header_font.family }},{{ settings.type_header_font.fallback_families }};font-size:{{ block.settings.product_title_size }}px;color:{{ block.settings.title_color }};margin:0 0 12px}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-title a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-media{width:100%;aspect-ratio:{{ block.settings.image_ratio }};overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:transparent}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-media img{width:100%;height:100%;max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:{{ block.settings.image_fit }};display:block}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-media svg{width:100%;height:100%}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-info{display:flex;flex:1 1 auto;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding-top:14px}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-price{font-size:{{ block.settings.price_size }}px;color:{{ block.settings.price_color }};font-weight:600}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-price-note,.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-description{font-size:{{ block.settings.text_size }}px;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }}}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-description p{margin:0}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-learn{color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};text-underline-offset:3px}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-variants{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:{{ block.settings.variant_gap }}px}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-variant{min-height:{{ block.settings.variant_size }}px;padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid {{ block.settings.variant_border }};border-radius:{{ block.settings.variant_radius }}px;color:{{ block.settings.variant_text }};background:{{ block.settings.variant_bg }};cursor:pointer;font:inherit;font-size:14px}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-variant[aria-pressed=true]{background:{{ block.settings.variant_selected_bg }};color:{{ block.settings.variant_selected_text }};border-color:{{ block.settings.variant_selected_bg }}}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-variant:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-buy{margin-top:auto;padding-top:16px}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-add{width:100%;min-height:48px;border:0;border-radius:{{ block.settings.button_radius }}px;background:{{ block.settings.button_color }};color:{{ block.settings.button_text_color }};cursor:pointer;font:inherit}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-add:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed}
.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-status{min-height:1.2em;font-size:13px;margin-top:6px}
@media(max-width:749px){.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}{padding:{{ block.settings.padding_mobile }}px {{ block.settings.side_padding }}px}.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat({{ block.settings.columns_mobile }},minmax(0,1fr))}.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-grid--carousel{grid-auto-columns:minmax(70%,1fr);grid-auto-flow:column;grid-template-columns:none;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;padding-bottom:8px}.ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-fc-grid--carousel>*{scroll-snap-align:start}}
{% endstyle %}
<featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="ai-fc-inner">{% if block.settings.show_heading and featured_collection != blank %}<h2 class="ai-fc-heading">{{ block.settings.heading | default: featured_collection.title | escape }}</h2>{% endif %}{% if featured_collection != blank %}<div class="ai-fc-grid{% if block.settings.mobile_carousel %} ai-fc-grid--carousel{% endif %}">{% for product in featured_collection.products limit: block.settings.products_to_show %}{% assign initial_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant | default: product.variants.first %}<article class="ai-fc-card" data-card>{% if block.settings.show_title %}<h3 class="ai-fc-title"><a href="{{ product.url }}">{{ product.title | escape }}</a></h3>{% endif %}<a class="ai-fc-media" href="{{ product.url }}" aria-label="{{ product.title | escape }}">{% if initial_variant.featured_image %}<img data-product-image src="{{ initial_variant.featured_image | image_url: width: 1000 }}" alt="{{ initial_variant.featured_image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ initial_variant.featured_image.width }}" height="{{ initial_variant.featured_image.height }}">{% elsif product.featured_image %}<img data-product-image src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 1000 }}" alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ product.featured_image.width }}" height="{{ product.featured_image.height }}">{% else %}<div data-product-image>{{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>{% endif %}</a><div class="ai-fc-info">{% if block.settings.show_price %}<div class="ai-fc-price"><span data-price>{{ initial_variant.price | money }}</span>{% if block.settings.show_price_description %} <span class="ai-fc-price-note" data-price-note></span>{% endif %}</div>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.show_description %}{% capture description_key %}description_{{ forloop.index }}{% endcapture %}<div class="ai-fc-description">{% if block.settings[description_key] != blank %}{{ block.settings[description_key] }}{% else %}{{ product.description | strip_html | truncate: 180 | escape }}{% endif %}</div>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.show_learn_more %}<a class="ai-fc-learn" href="{{ product.url }}">{{ block.settings.learn_label | escape }}</a>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.show_variants and product.variants.size > 1 %}<div class="ai-fc-variants" role="group" aria-label="Choose a variant for {{ product.title | escape }}">{% for variant in product.variants %}{% assign variant_image = variant.featured_image | default: product.featured_image %}<button type="button" class="ai-fc-variant" data-variant data-id="{{ variant.id }}" data-price="{{ variant.price | money }}"
data-note="{{ variant.metafields.custom.price_description.value | escape }}"
data-available="{{ variant.available }}"" data-image="{% if variant_image %}{{ variant_image | image_url: width: 1000 }}{% endif %}" data-alt="{{ variant_image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}" aria-pressed="{% if variant.id == initial_variant.id %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" {% unless variant.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>{{ variant.title | escape }}</button>{% endfor %}</div>{% endif %}</div><div class="ai-fc-buy">{% if block.settings.show_add_button %}<button class="ai-fc-add" type="button" data-add data-variant-id="{{ initial_variant.id }}" {% unless initial_variant.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>{{ block.settings.add_label | escape }}</button><div class="ai-fc-status" aria-live="polite" data-status></div>{% endif %}</div></article>{% endfor %}</div>{% else %}<p>Select a collection in the block settings.</p>{% endif %}</div></featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>
(function () {
  const tag = 'featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}';

  if (customElements.get(tag)) return;

  class FeaturedCollection{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
    connectedCallback() {
      this.querySelectorAll('[data-card]').forEach((card) => {
        const addButton = card.querySelector('[data-add]');
        const status = card.querySelector('[data-status]');

        /* =========================
           VARIANT SELECTION
        ========================= */

        card.querySelectorAll('[data-variant]').forEach((button) => {
          button.addEventListener('click', () => {

            /* Selected button state */
            card.querySelectorAll('[data-variant]').forEach((item) => {
              item.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'false');
            });

            button.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'true');

            /* Update selected variant ID */
            if (addButton) {
              addButton.dataset.variantId = button.dataset.id;
            }

            /* Update price */
            const price = card.querySelector('[data-price]');

            if (price && button.dataset.price) {
              price.textContent = button.dataset.price;
            }

            /* Update variant price description */
            const note = card.querySelector('[data-price-note]');

            if (note) {
              const noteText = button.dataset.note || '';
              note.textContent = noteText ? `(${noteText})` : '';
            }

            /* Update product image */
            const image = card.querySelector('[data-product-image]');

            if (image && button.dataset.image) {
              image.src = button.dataset.image;
              image.srcset = '';
              image.alt = button.dataset.alt || '';
            }

            /* Update availability */
            const available = button.dataset.available === 'true';

            if (addButton) {
              addButton.disabled = !available;
            }

            if (status) {
              status.textContent = '';
            }
          });
        });


        /* =========================
           ADD TO BAG
        ========================= */

        if (addButton) {
          addButton.addEventListener('click', async () => {

            const variantId = addButton.dataset.variantId;

            if (!variantId) {
              if (status) {
                status.textContent = 'Please select an option.';
              }
              return;
            }

            addButton.disabled = true;

            try {

              const root =
                window.Shopify &&
                Shopify.routes &&
                Shopify.routes.root
                  ? Shopify.routes.root
                  : '/';


              /* Get Luxe cart drawer */
              const cartDrawer =
                document.querySelector('cart-drawer');


             /* Build request for Luxe cart drawer */
const formData = new FormData();

formData.append('id', variantId);
formData.append('quantity', '1');

if (
  cartDrawer &&
  typeof cartDrawer.getSectionsToRender === 'function'
) {
  const sections = cartDrawer
    .getSectionsToRender()
    .map((section) => section.id);

  formData.append('sections', sections.join(','));
  formData.append('sections_url', window.location.pathname);
}

/* Add selected variant */
const response = await fetch(
  root + 'cart/add.js',
  {
    method: 'POST',
    headers: {
      'Accept': 'application/json'
    },
    body: formData
  }
);

const result = await response.json();


              /* Shopify returned an error */
              if (!response.ok) {
                throw new Error(
                  result.description ||
                  result.message ||
                  'Unable to add this item.'
                );
              }


              /*
               * Hand Shopify's response directly
               * to Luxe's native cart drawer.
               *
               * Luxe handles:
               * - drawer contents
               * - cart count
               * - drawer opening
               */
            if (
  cartDrawer &&
  typeof cartDrawer.renderContents === 'function'
) {
  cartDrawer.renderContents(result);

  if (cartDrawer.classList.contains('is-empty')) {
    cartDrawer.classList.remove('is-empty');
  }
}


              /* Success message */
              if (status) {
                status.textContent =
                  {{ block.settings.success_label | json }};
              }


            } catch (error) {

              console.error(
                'Featured Collection add to cart error:',
                error
              );

              if (status) {
                status.textContent =
                  error.message ||
                  'Unable to add this item.';
              }

            } finally {

              /*
               * Restore correct Add to Bag state
               * for the currently selected variant.
               */
              const selected = card.querySelector(
                '[data-variant][aria-pressed="true"]'
              );

              if (selected) {
                addButton.disabled =
                  selected.dataset.available !== 'true';
              } else {
                addButton.disabled = false;
              }

            }
          });
        }

      });
    }
  }


  customElements.define(
    tag,
    FeaturedCollection{{ ai_gen_id }}
  );

})();
</script>
